   "description": "Moving services for U.S. military households and service members relocating to or from the Winchester and Martinsburg area, quoted flat in writing before move day. Whole-home moves with full, partial or fragile-only packing and unpacking, room-by-room placement and a closing walkthrough, local, regional and long-distance on I-81, I-66 and I-70, with dates planned around the household's reporting timeline. Heavy pieces — safes, pianos and equipment, including medical devices, cryogenic equipment and antiques in the 1,500 to 3,500 lb band — are planned under SIR Structural Integrity Relocation and the KIM-GS Protocol with an L/360 floor check instead of left to chance. This is a direct-hire service for military households: no transportation-service-provider status, no Defense Personal Property System participation, no government contract and no clearance is claimed for this service. Guaranteed Flat Rate or Your Move is Free!",
