     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "What does Military Moving include?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Moving services for U.S. military households and service members relocating to or from the Winchester and Martinsburg area — whole-home moves, packing and unpacking, and the heavy pieces (safes, pianos, equipment) planned under SIR and the KIM-GS Protocol, local, regional and long-distance on I-81, I-66 and I-70, with full, partial or fragile-only packing."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Who is Military Moving for?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "This service is for U.S. military households and service members relocating to or from the Winchester and Martinsburg area."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Can you plan around orders and deadlines?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Yes — relocations run on orders and deadlines, not convenience, so dates are planned in advance around your reporting timeline; tell us the window in the quote form."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Are heavy pieces covered?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Yes — safes, pianos, and equipment up to 3,500 lbs are planned under SIR and KIM-GS, with route survey and L/360 floor check."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Is the price flat?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Yes — one flat rate in writing before move day."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "How do I get a flat-rate quote for Military Moving?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Get My Flat Rate Quote — Short (Quick Quote) by default, or Detailed Project; From, To, and What's moving stay filled in when you switch. Tell us the reporting window in the quote form."
     }
